1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,609
Ten thousand pounds to

2
00:00:01,609 --> 00:00:02,906
put on your mortgage,

3
00:00:02,906 --> 00:00:03,770
five years in?

4
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:05,191
You've got two choices.

5
00:00:05,191 --> 00:00:06,796
Keep the payment the same,

6
00:00:06,796 --> 00:00:09,205
and you finish twenty-two months early,

7
00:00:09,205 --> 00:00:10,872
with about sixteen thousand

8
00:00:10,872 --> 00:00:12,169
pounds less interest.

9
00:00:12,169 --> 00:00:13,466
Or cut the payment by

10
00:00:13,466 --> 00:00:15,380
about sixty-six pounds a month,

11
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,171
and save about five thousand,

12
00:00:17,171 --> 00:00:18,036
eight hundred.

13
00:00:18,036 --> 00:00:19,827
The shorter term saves nearly

14
00:00:19,827 --> 00:00:21,062
